# Trade enquiry endpoint — /api/enquiry
#
# Nothing here is required. With no variables set, every enquiry is still
# written to the function log, which is readable in the Vercel dashboard.
# Set one or both of these to keep a real record.

# --- Durable store (recommended) -------------------------------------------
# Vercel dashboard → Storage → Upstash Redis. Connecting the store injects
# these automatically; you do not have to paste them by hand.
# Enquiries are pushed onto the list `enquiries`, newest first.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# --- Email to the trade desk ------------------------------------------------
# resend.com → API keys. Until farmologic.io is verified with Resend, mail can
# only be sent from onboarding@resend.dev, which is the default here.
RESEND_API_KEY=
ENQUIRY_TO=contact@farmologic.io
ENQUIRY_FROM=Farmologic site <onboarding@resend.dev>
